      <link>https://m.zhibo8.com/news/web/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1b5215b6db6native.htm</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【巴黎卫冕欧冠】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/match1944224date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">卫冕欧冠！巴黎点球大战5-4击败阿森纳夺冠 加布里埃尔、埃泽失点</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260531/zhanbao_image_1944224_1780169462_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260531/zhanbao_image_1944224_1780169462_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260531/zhanbao_image_1944224_1780169462_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>巴黎夺得本赛季欧冠冠军，成为欧冠改制后第2个卫冕冠军；本赛季联赛+欧冠双冠王。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a18dd9a82688native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">🏆连庄称王！巴黎获得本赛季欧冠冠军 欧冠改制后第2个卫冕冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290828435402.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290828435402.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290828435402.jpg"> </div><p>今日凌晨进行的欧冠决赛，巴黎战胜阿森纳，夺得本赛季欧冠冠军！这是巴黎队史的第二个欧冠冠军，他们连续两年夺冠，在欧冠中实现卫冕！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1b060c62a86native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创历史！巴黎成功卫冕欧冠冠军，此前只有皇马卫冕改制后欧冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605302347326735.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605302347326735.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260530/202605302347326735.jpg"> </div><p>巴黎在欧冠赛事中成功实现卫冕，在欧冠改制后至今，在巴黎之前只有皇马一支球队实现欧冠卫冕（15/16、16/17、17/18）。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1b2effafb09native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冲击连庄金球！登贝莱赛季20球11助卫冕欧冠，赛季5冠冲击世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310248444050.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310248444050.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310248444050.jpg"> </div><p>本赛季登贝莱代表巴黎出战40场比赛，贡献20粒进球和11次助攻，帮助球队赢得欧冠、法甲、洲际杯、法国超级杯、欧洲超级杯在内的5座冠军奖杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1b2e8aed3aanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冠军主帅！恩里克带领巴黎卫冕欧冠冠军，执教3夺欧冠历史第二</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310250052817.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310250052817.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310250052817.jpg"> </div><p>2025/26赛季欧冠决赛，巴黎战胜阿森纳，成功卫冕欧冠冠军。巴黎主帅恩里克也夺得了个人第三座欧冠冠军。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1b36d8a17b4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">捧杯时刻！巴黎卫冕欧冠颁奖典礼：马尔基尼奥斯捧起欧冠奖杯！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/6a1b3a6999cfc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.53" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/6a1b3a6999cfc.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/6a1b3a6999cfc.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠决赛，巴黎点球大战战胜阿森纳夺冠，卫冕欧冠冠军。马尔基尼奥斯代表球队捧起欧冠奖杯！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1b36ba2a1denative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">维球王！官方：维蒂尼亚当选欧冠决赛最佳球员，助巴黎卫冕欧冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310320005925.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310320005925.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310320005925.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，维蒂尼亚当选欧冠决赛最佳球员，巴黎最终点球大战击败阿森纳卫冕。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1b1b708674enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">成功卫冕！欧冠冠军数：皇马15冠第1，米兰7冠第2，巴黎2冠升第9</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230316/64120712843ad.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230316/64120712843ad.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_230316/64120712843ad.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠决赛，巴黎点球大战击败阿森纳卫冕，目前欧冠夺冠次数最多是皇马的15次，米兰7冠第2，巴黎2冠并列第9。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1a036c05868native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴黎夺冠！25/26赛季欧冠奖金榜：巴黎1.26亿镑第1，枪手1.22亿镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605071542293402.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605071542293402_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260507/202605071542293402_720.jpg"> </div><p>25/26赛季欧冠决赛结束，巴黎成功卫冕。欧冠各阶段奖金此前就已公布，至此，完整的本赛季欧冠奖金榜也已经出炉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1a1b9187caenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆总尴尬了！姆巴佩效力巴黎7年0座欧冠，走后巴黎豪取欧冠两连冠</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/69e032506f179.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/69e032506f179.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/69e032506f179.jpg"> </div><p>本赛季欧冠决赛结束，巴黎击败阿森纳，捧得25/26赛季欧冠冠军，成功卫冕！这也意味着，巴黎在姆巴佩离开后，连续两个赛季都拿到了欧冠。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1a12495bc89native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">相同剧本再来一遍！巴黎连续2年从淘汰赛附加赛晋级，夺欧冠冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/69f16a7a9f7e4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/69f16a7a9f7e4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260429/69f16a7a9f7e4.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠决赛落幕，巴黎击败阿森纳，成功卫冕欧冠！巴黎重演了上赛季的剧本，即从淘汰赛附加赛晋级，并最终夺冠。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-31/6a1afe71aa3fbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">含金量十足！巴黎卫冕之路：双杀切尔西和利物浦，胜拜仁、阿森纳</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.58" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260531/202605310